          "before": "Reconciled Core, CRs, ARM, NS, and TCs for AGCP v.2.0. DS-042 is the canonical versioned, attributable, traceable, machine-evaluable output of Governance Compilation and preserves deterministic Compilation Context and complete Governance Artifact Lineage.",
